stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Inspect
  Inspect --> ContractReady : G2 approved
  ContractReady --> Implement
  Implement --> Integrity
  Integrity --> Blocked : oracle or tool missing
  Integrity --> Render
  Render --> Measure
  Measure --> Repair : rule FAIL
  Measure --> CompareRegions
  CompareRegions --> Repair : FAIL
  CompareRegions --> Integration : PASS or REVIEW classified
  Integration --> BehaviorA11y
  BehaviorA11y --> Accepted : all required PASS
  Repair --> Render : round up to 3 and improving
  Repair --> Failed : budget exhausted or no improvement
  Accepted --> [*]
  note right of CompareRegions
    uncalibrated means REVIEW, never PASS
  end note
